# News & Economic Calendar Filter Implementation - Walkthrough

## Overview

Successfully implemented the **News and Economic Calendar Filter** feature as specified in the v1.2.1 implementation plan. This critical risk management feature blocks trades around high-impact economic events and integrates sentiment analysis into the trading strategy.

## Changes Made

### Core News Filter Module

#### [news.py](file:///c:/Users/TalentBridgeDubai/Documents/app-web-dev/trx/src/v1_0/core/news.py)

Implemented complete [NewsEngine](file:///c:/Users/TalentBridgeDubai/Documents/app-web-dev/trx/src/v1_0/core/news.py#27-184) class (+184 lines):
- **Economic Calendar Loading**: Reads events from CSV with timestamp parsing
- **Event Blocking Logic**: Checks 45-min before and 30-min after high-impact events  
- **Sentiment Analysis**: Keyword-based scoring (-1.0 to +1.0) from news headlines
- **Currency-Instrument Mapping**: Maps USD, EUR, GBP, XAU, BTC, NAS to trading instruments
- **Key Methods**:
  - [is_blocked()](file:///c:/Users/TalentBridgeDubai/Documents/app-web-dev/trx/src/v1_0/core/news.py#77-112): Returns `True` if trading should be blocked for instrument/time
  - [get_sentiment_score()](file:///c:/Users/TalentBridgeDubai/Documents/app-web-dev/trx/src/v1_0/core/news.py#113-155): Analyzes headlines from last 24 hours
  - [should_reduce_risk()](file:///c:/Users/TalentBridgeDubai/Documents/app-web-dev/trx/src/v1_0/core/news.py#156-184): Returns `True` if sentiment opposes trade direction

---

### Configuration Updates

#### [config.yaml](file:///c:/Users/TalentBridgeDubai/Documents/app-web-dev/trx/config/config.yaml)

Added news filter configuration section:
```yaml
news:
  enabled: true
  calendar_path: "data/economic_calendar.csv"
  headlines_path: "data/news_headlines.csv"
  block_before_minutes: 45
  block_after_minutes: 30
  high_impact_only: true
  sentiment_threshold: -0.5
```

#### [config.py](file:///c:/Users/TalentBridgeDubai/Documents/app-web-dev/trx/src/v1_0/core/config.py)

- Added [NewsConfig](file:///c:/Users/TalentBridgeDubai/Documents/app-web-dev/trx/src/v1_0/core/news.py#15-25) dataclass with all filter settings
- Integrated into [AppConfig](file:///c:/Users/TalentBridgeDubai/Documents/app-web-dev/trx/src/v1_0/core/config.py#44-50) 
- Updated [load_config()](file:///c:/Users/TalentBridgeDubai/Documents/app-web-dev/trx/src/v1_0/core/config.py#52-96) to parse news configuration from YAML

