### Strategy Engine Integration

#### [strategy.py](file:///c:/Users/TalentBridgeDubai/Documents/app-web-dev/trx/src/v1_0/core/strategy.py)

**Modified [Signal](file:///c:/Users/TalentBridgeDubai/Documents/app-web-dev/trx/src/v1_0/core/strategy.py#20-31) dataclass** to include:
- `news_blocked: bool = False`
- `sentiment_score: float = 0.0`

**Updated [StrategyEngine](file:///c:/Users/TalentBridgeDubai/Documents/app-web-dev/trx/src/v1_0/core/strategy.py#40-132)**:
- Added optional `news_engine` parameter to [__init__()](file:///c:/Users/TalentBridgeDubai/Documents/app-web-dev/trx/src/v1_0/core/strategy.py#55-61)
- Integrated news filtering in [generate_signals()](file:///c:/Users/TalentBridgeDubai/Documents/app-web-dev/trx/src/v1_0/core/strategy.py#71-132):
  1. Checks [is_blocked()](file:///c:/Users/TalentBridgeDubai/Documents/app-web-dev/trx/src/v1_0/core/news.py#77-112) before creating signal
  2. Checks [should_reduce_risk()](file:///c:/Users/TalentBridgeDubai/Documents/app-web-dev/trx/src/v1_0/core/news.py#156-184) to filter opposing sentiment
  3. Populates `news_blocked` and [sentiment_score](file:///c:/Users/TalentBridgeDubai/Documents/app-web-dev/trx/src/v1_0/core/news.py#113-155) fields

**Backward Compatible**: News engine parameter is optional; existing code continues to work.

